                                    From day one of Nomad Magazine's existence, we dreamed of celebrating the spaces that fuel our productivity. We've been fortunate to work with <strong style="color:#111827">beautiful coworking spaces hosting our magazine</strong> — and we've been blown away by the creativity owners and designers put into crafting environments with remote workers' comfort in mind.
                                  </p>
