                                    <strong style="color:#111827">How it works:</strong> The winner will be selected through public votes, with final curation by the Nomad Magazine team and our partners as jury. We'll feature the most beautiful spaces in the next edition, sharing their stories and featuring the artistry behind exceptional design.
                                  </p>
                                  <p class="brand-body" style="Margin:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;-ms-text-size-adjust:none;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;font-size:16px;color:#374151;margin-bottom:16px">
